{"seq":3,"slug":"positional-encoding-basics","title":"位置编码基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/foundations/positional-encoding-basics","wordCount":1568,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"位置编码基础\">位置编码基础</h1><p>自注意力本身是&quot;无序&quot;的：把输入 token 打乱顺序，注意力算出来的结果完全一样——因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><msup><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">QK^\\top</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 只看内容不看位置。可语言里&quot;狗咬人&quot;和&quot;人咬狗&quot;天差地别。位置编码就是补回这份顺序信息的机制，而它恰恰决定了一个模型在训练长度之外还能不能正常工作。要理解第二章为什么能靠&quot;改位置编码&quot;把窗口撑大，得先把位置编码本身的几种范式讲清楚。本篇只讲编码机制，扩展手段（插值、NTK、YaRN）留给 <a href=\"../extension-methods/rope-scaling\">RoPE 缩放</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-把位置注入注意力的三种范式\">核心概念：把位置注入注意力的三种范式</h2><p>位置编码大致分三代：把位置直接加到词向量上的绝对编码、把相对距离编进注意力分数的相对编码、以及用旋转把相对位置隐含进 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q/K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 的 RoPE。它们对长度外推的友好程度差异极大。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[自注意力本身无序&lt;br/&gt;需注入位置信息] --&gt; B[绝对位置编码]&#10;  A --&gt; C[相对位置编码]&#10;  A --&gt; D[旋转位置编码 RoPE]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[可学习绝对&lt;br/&gt;外推差 训练长度即上限]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[正弦编码&lt;br/&gt;有外推潜力但不稳]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[相对偏置 / ALiBi&lt;br/&gt;外推友好]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[按频率旋转 Q K&lt;br/&gt;主流 但需缩放才能延长]\">graph TD\n  A[自注意力本身无序&lt;br/&gt;需注入位置信息] --&gt; B[绝对位置编码]\n  A --&gt; C[相对位置编码]\n  A --&gt; D[旋转位置编码 RoPE]\n  B --&gt; B1[可学习绝对&lt;br/&gt;外推差 训练长度即上限]\n  B --&gt; B2[正弦编码&lt;br/&gt;有外推潜力但不稳]\n  C --&gt; C1[相对偏置 / ALiBi&lt;br/&gt;外推友好]\n  D --&gt; D1[按频率旋转 Q K&lt;br/&gt;主流 但需缩放才能延长]</pre><p>下表把四种代表性方案在关键维度上对照，作为后续讨论的索引。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>位置如何注入</th>\n<th>编码的是</th>\n<th>长度外推</th>\n<th>代表模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可学习绝对</td>\n<td>加到词向量</td>\n<td>绝对位置</td>\n<td>差，训练长度即硬上限</td>\n<td>早期 BERT/GPT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正弦编码</td>\n<td>加到词向量</td>\n<td>绝对位置</td>\n<td>有潜力但实测不稳</td>\n<td>原始 Transformer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ALiBi</td>\n<td>注意力分数加线性偏置</td>\n<td>相对距离</td>\n<td>友好，可直接外推</td>\n<td>BLOOM、部分开源模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RoPE</td>\n<td>旋转 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q,K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>相对位置</td>\n<td>需缩放，但缩放后效果最好</td>\n<td>LLaMA、Qwen、多数现代模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"绝对编码-为什么训练长度成了硬墙\">绝对编码：为什么训练长度成了硬墙</h2><p>最早的做法是给每个位置一个向量，直接加到该位置的词向量上。可学习版本给位置 0 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{\\max}-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 各学一个嵌入——问题立刻暴露：位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 及以后从来没有对应的嵌入，模型遇到超出训练长度的位置时<strong>根本没有可用的位置信号</strong>，表现急剧崩坏。这就是早期模型上下文窗口被死死钉在训练长度的根因。</p>\n<p>正弦编码（原始 Transformer）用不同频率的正余弦函数生成位置向量，理论上对任意位置都有定义、似乎能外推。但实践中，模型在训练时只见过短位置对应的那段函数取值，对长位置的函数取值依旧陌生，外推往往不稳。绝对编码这条路的根本局限是：它编码的是&quot;第几个&quot;，而注意力真正在乎的是&quot;相隔多远&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相对编码与-alibi-把距离编进分数\">相对编码与 ALiBi：把距离编进分数</h2><p>相对位置编码换了思路：不告诉模型每个 token 的绝对座位号，而是告诉它任意两个 token 之间相隔多远。ALiBi（Attention with Linear Biases）是其中最简洁的代表——它不在词向量上做任何加法，而是在注意力分数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><msup><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">QK^\\top</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上直接减去一个与距离成正比的惩罚：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(i,j) = q_i \\cdot k_j - m \\cdot |i - j|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 是每个头固定的斜率。离得越远，惩罚越大，注意力越弱。因为它编码的是相对距离而非绝对位置，模型在更长的序列上只是把同一条线性规律延伸出去，外推天然友好——这是 ALiBi 受欢迎的核心原因。代价是这种&quot;越远越弱&quot;的硬性先验在某些需要远距离精确检索的任务上偏强。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rope-用旋转隐含相对位置\">RoPE：用旋转隐含相对位置</h2><p>旋转位置编码（RoPE）是当前绝对主流——LLaMA、Qwen、DeepSeek 等几乎都用它。它的巧思是把位置信息编成<strong>旋转</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 的每一对维度，按位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 旋转一个角度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m\\theta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，不同维度用不同频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10000</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_i = 10000^{-2i/d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。低维转得快（高频，捕捉近距离），高维转得慢（低频，捕捉远距离）。</p>\n<p>旋转的妙处在于：两个位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m,n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 的 query 和 key 做点积时，旋转角相减，结果只依赖<strong>相对位置</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m-n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>。于是 RoPE 用绝对位置的旋转，自然得到了相对位置的注意力——兼得绝对编码的实现简洁与相对编码的外推友好。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle R_m q,\\ R_n k \\rangle = \\langle q,\\ R_{n-m} k \\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>但 RoPE 并非天生能外推：超出训练长度时，那些高频维度的旋转角会进入训练时从未见过的取值区间，注意力随之崩坏。这正是第二章一整族技术（位置插值、NTK-aware、YaRN）要解决的问题——它们本质上都是在改写这里的频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与位置映射，让长位置&quot;折算&quot;回训练见过的范围。机制详见 <a href=\"../extension-methods/rope-scaling\">RoPE 缩放</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"频率与可外推性-长上下文的隐线\">频率与可外推性：长上下文的隐线</h2><p>把上面几节串起来会发现一条隐线：能否外推，取决于位置编码对&quot;训练时没见过的位置&quot;是否还有合理的信号。绝对编码没有，所以训练长度即上限；ALiBi 把规律编成可无限延伸的线性距离，所以外推友好；RoPE 把位置编成多频率旋转，外推能力卡在高频维度，于是留出了&quot;调频率即可延长&quot;的接口。理解这条隐线，你就能预判第二章每种手段的着力点：它们都是在频率与位置映射这两个旋钮上做文章。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>自注意力本身无序，位置编码补回顺序；它决定模型在训练长度外能否工作。</li>\n<li>绝对编码（可学习/正弦）编&quot;第几个&quot;，外推差，训练长度成硬墙。</li>\n<li>ALiBi 等相对编码编&quot;相隔多远&quot;，把距离写成线性惩罚，外推天然友好。</li>\n<li>RoPE 用多频率旋转，让绝对旋转得到相对注意力，是主流；但高频维度限制了原生外推，留出&quot;调频率延长&quot;的接口——这正是 RoPE 缩放的切入点。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>如何改写 RoPE 频率把窗口撑大：<a href=\"../extension-methods/rope-scaling\">RoPE 缩放</a></li>\n<li>位置编码与中间遗失的关系：<a href=\"../practice/context-rot-failures\">中间遗失与上下文腐烂</a></li>\n<li>注意力本身的复杂度：<a href=\"attention-complexity\">注意力复杂度与瓶颈</a></li>\n<li>跨 hub：注意力机制基础——<a href=\"../../llm-fundamentals/foundations/attention-mechanism\">LLM 基础 · 注意力机制</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"位置编码基础","id":"位置编码基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把位置注入注意力的三种范式","id":"核心概念-把位置注入注意力的三种范式"},{"level":2,"text":"绝对编码：为什么训练长度成了硬墙","id":"绝对编码-为什么训练长度成了硬墙"},{"level":2,"text":"相对编码与 ALiBi：把距离编进分数","id":"相对编码与-alibi-把距离编进分数"},{"level":2,"text":"RoPE：用旋转隐含相对位置","id":"rope-用旋转隐含相对位置"},{"level":2,"text":"频率与可外推性：长上下文的隐线","id":"频率与可外推性-长上下文的隐线"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"注意力复杂度与瓶颈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/foundations/attention-complexity"},"next":{"title":"RoPE 缩放","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/extension-methods/rope-scaling"}}